  shortDescription: Strikes down the next hazard brick.
  ownedShortDescription:
  description: Holds a charge that strikes down the next hazard brick. Let it fall
    for a beat and the ward burns it back into a plain brick of the same shape - a
    Maw, Vortex or Bomb defused in front of you, just once. It waits until a hazard
    actually shows up, so the charge is never wasted.
